    drv_rtc.c.j2 - RTC driver with sorted alarm queue
    硬件：HAL_RTC_Init + Alarm A / WakeUp 1s 心跳
    软件：按 deadline_sec 排序的定时器链表，Alarm A 精确匹配队首到期时间
#}

